    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d263">

                <pb facs="0481" n="471" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg471"/>

                <head>Mr. Washburn to Mr. Jackson.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Portland,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 11, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Cargo of Chesapeake was owned entirely by American and Canadian merchants, and
                    was not intended to run blockade. Advise authorities of fact, as the piracy was
                    projected in St. John. I suppose they will not permit Chesapeake to leave their
                    ports.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ISRAEL WASHBURN, <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jr.,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Collector.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
